section -- merged from Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.AutomorphicForms.SmoothRepresentationsGL.OrthConv
open NumberField IsDedekindDomain MeasureTheory Matrix GroundTheory.Automorphic GroundTheory.Automorphic.AutomorphicForm
